        "jp_sha256": "ab1fbcee08270de7a84846a9ac779e2c6b1d119e5f593f43cc620b1af27ac661",
        "official_en_sha256": "28bbd079e4c6a3c5750451a2228c38b2162f32e8f17c1c947771a78a6491dd5a"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ビジョンとは思いの力が結晶化した”幻影”です。\r\n幻影の元となった戦士や魔道士の力を借りることが出来ます。\r\n\r\n力を引き出すには、装備しなければなりません。\r\n\r\nメインメニューの「装備＆アビリティ」から\r\nビジョンを装備してみましょう。",
        "official_en": "Visions are the crystallized essences of legendary\r\nheroes that grant you their strength.\r\n\r\nTo harness a vision’s power, they must first be\r\nequipped.\r\n\r\nTry equipping one from the Equipment & Abilities\r\nscreen in the Main Menu.",
        "real_en": "A vision is a phantom formed from the crystallized power of people’s feelings. It lets you borrow the strength of the warriors and mages from whom the phantoms originated.\r\n\r\nTo draw out that power, you must equip the vision. Try equipping one under Equipment & Abilities in the Main Menu."
      },
